{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19049","headline":"牛相公留守见示城外新墅有溪竹秋月亲情多往宿游恨不得去因成四韵兼简洛中亲故之什兼命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"牛相公留守见示城外新墅有溪竹秋月亲情多往宿游恨不得去因成四韵兼简洛中亲故之什兼命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别墅洛城外，月明村野通。\n光辉满地上，丝管发舟中。\n堤艳菊花露，岛凉松叶风。\n高情限清禁，寒漏滴深宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}